================================================================================
Design references (no source code copied)
================================================================================

This project was written from scratch. Two open-source projects were studied for
their design decisions, and no source file from either is included here. They
are credited because the *approach* was informed by them:

  xxnuo/dns-benchmark  (https://github.com/xxnuo/dns-benchmark)
    - concurrency model: a global worker pool whose unit of work is one DNS
      server
    - the field layout of the exported result JSON
    - the "batch visual analysis" interaction idea for the web viewer

    NOTE ON LICENSING: this repository declares NO license (GitHub reports its
    license field as null). No source code from it is included here, so nothing
    is redistributed; the credit above is an acknowledgement of design
    influence, not a license obligation. If you are the rights holder and would
    like the attribution worded differently, please open an issue.

  palemoky/dnspick  (https://github.com/palemoky/dnspick, MIT License)
    - connection reuse and warm-up strategy (DoT long connections, DoH
      keep-alive)
    - the per-domain-category TUI progress panel
    - system DNS detection and the "should I switch?" verdict idea

    dnspick is MIT-licensed. No source code from it is included here either.

The DNS server inventory and the domestic / international domain lists shipped
in this repository were compiled independently for this project.

================================================================================
External test domains used by the resolver type detection
================================================================================

The optional "detect built-in DNS type" feature queries publicly documented
category test domains in order to observe whether a resolver filters:

  malware.testcategory.com        Cloudflare 1.1.1.1 for Families self-test
  phishing.testcategory.com       same zone; NOT published by Cloudflare
  advertising.filterdns.net       DNSFilter advertising-category self-test
  googleads.g.doubleclick.net     generally-listed advertising domain
  pagead2.googlesyndication.com   generally-listed advertising domain
  ad.doubleclick.net              generally-listed advertising domain

These names are queried at runtime only; no data from them is bundled, and the
trademarks belong to their respective owners.
